==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈriːða/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|iːða|lang=is}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|ríða||to ride}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*rīdaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*reydʰ-}}, cognate with English {{m|en|ride}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-strong|reið|riðu|riðið}}

# {{label|is|transitive|takes the dative|especially on horseback}} to [[ride]]{{jump|is|ride|s}}
#* ''Á Sprengisandi'' (“On Sprengisandur”) by [[w:en:Grímur Thomsen|Grímur Thomsen]]
#*: '''Ríðum''', '''ríðum''' og rekum yfir sandinn,
#*: rennur sól á bak við Arnarfell,
#*: hér á reiki er margur óhreinn andinn,
#*: úr því fer að skyggja á jökulsvell;
#*: Drottinn leiði drösulinn minn,
#*: drjúgur verður síðasti áfanginn.
#*:: '''Ride''', '''ride''', '''ride''' hard across the sands,
#*:: the sun is settling behind Arnarfell.
#*:: Here many spirits of the dark
#*:: threaten in the gloom over the glacier's ice.
#*:: The Lord leads my horse,
#*:: it is still a long, long way home.
#: ''Að fara '''ríðandi'''.''
#:: To '''go on''' horseback.
# {{label|is|ambitransitive|takes the dative|vulgar}} to [[fuck]] someone, to [[have sex]] with{{jump|is|fuck|s}}
#: ''Langar þig að '''ríða'''?''
#:: Do you wanna '''fuck'''?
#: '''''Ríddu''' mér.''
#:: [[fuck me|'''Fuck''' me]].
#: ''Hvað er langt síðan þú hefur '''riðið'''?''
#:: How long is it since your last '''shag'''?
# {{label|is|takes the dative case}}
#: ''Fréttirnar '''riðu''' honum að fullu.''
#:: The news '''finished''' him off.
#: ''Þetta '''ríður''' á miklu.''
#:: This is '''very important'''.
# {{label|is|transitive|takes the accusative}}
#: ''Ég [[ríða af sér|'''reið''' hann af mér]].''
#:: I '''rode''' faster than he did.

